   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 1,000eb (Very Expensive)</p>\n<p><em>“Snap back to reality without a headache. …Why do you always say ‘Whoops, there goes gravity’ after I say the first part?”</em></p>\n<p><strong>Kerenzikov Cyberware Enhancement.</strong> For the first Round of combat after the user rolls initiative, any damage they suffer is reduced by 2 (after armor). If the damage would break through the user’s SP but be negated by Defenzikov, the armor is ablated as normal.</p>\n<p><em>NOTE: Inspired by a similar item created by Tann for the From the Ashes LC.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Enhances:</strong> Kerenzikov<br>\n<strong>Option Slots:</strong> 0 (Cyberware Enhancement)</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Cyberware &gt; Neuralware).</em></p>"
